        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect continued franchise development to result in a decrease in revenue from product sales and an increase in revenue generated from franchisees, primarily through a mix of: (i) fees, recognized over the term of the franchise agreement, (ii) ongoing royalty fees, calculated as a percentage of franchisee sales, and (iii) sales of product mix and equipment to franchisees.",
        "start_character": 9160,
        "end_character": 9537
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001857154-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001857154-26-000015-433c6a66258e9566",
        "accession_number": "0001857154-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate an integrated supply chain to help maintain the consistency and quality of products.",
