        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we continue to operate in a competitive market for talent, we believe that our culture, policies, and people and culture programs contribute to our strong relationship with our Krispy Kremers, which we feel is instrumental to our business model.",
