        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Company operates a global network of locations through a combination of Company-owned/operated and franchise-owned/operated shops and is planning to expand the franchising model globally going forward.",
